Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《蜘蛛侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:11.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁? 你真的想知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I? You sure you want to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胆小鬼千万别听我的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story of my life is not for the faint of heart. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人说这是个喜剧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If somebody said it was a happy little tale...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.54,0:03:22.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我也只是个平凡且无忧无虑的普通人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if somebody told you I was just an average guy, not a care in the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就被骗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...somebody lied. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我向你保证 这就跟其它的精彩故事一样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let me assure you, this, like any story worth telling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全是为了一个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is all about a girl. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:35.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是她 邻家的女孩 玛莉·珍·华森{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That girl. The girl next door. Mary Jane Watson. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:38.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从小就爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman I've loved since before I liked girls. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:41.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想说 坐在她身边的那个人就是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to tell you that's me next to her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:44.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唉 能当他也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, heck, I'd even take him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:47.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂! 停车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!Stop the bus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 叫他停车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to stop! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:53.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:55.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 停车!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Stop the bus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:59.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快停车! 他一路在追我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! He's been chasing us since Woodhaven. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去叫计程车啦! 派克!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch a cab, Parker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:08.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 抱歉我迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. I'm sorry I'm late. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真笨啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a geek!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:19.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想都别想 - 你真差劲 派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't even think about it.  - You're so lame, Parker. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:21.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会跟他约会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you date him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,市公立高三生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midtown High seniors. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.19,0:04:45.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别乱跑 直走到... 别闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wandering. Proceed direct... Knock it off. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:49.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住 这是个难得的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, it is a privilege to be here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是哥伦比亚大学科学院的客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're guests of Columbia University's Science Department. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:54.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家乖乖守规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So behave accordingly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别像上次在天文馆一样给我桶篓子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not have a repeat of our trip to the planetarium. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同学们 别走散了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, stay together. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.91,0:05:03.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起走进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed up the steps and into the building. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去哪了? - 去看图书馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where were you? - Checking out the library. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去看书啊 - 是啊 真的啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looking at the books.  - Yeah, right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以绕到角落去吗? - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we drive around the corner? - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:17.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,入口就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entrance is right there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:21.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 公立高中生不太好坐劳斯莱斯到啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, this is public school. I can't show up in a Rolls. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:23.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你被私立中学退学...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should trade my car for a Jetta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就该换辆福士金龟车吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because you flunked out of private school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:30.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那不合我 - 这当然适合你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wasn't for me.  - Of course it was. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:35.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 千万别以自己为耻 - 我才没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't ever be ashamed of who you are.  - I'm not ashamed of who I am. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:36.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是什么 哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what, Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:40.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 哈利 - 嗨 你好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Harry.  - Hey, man. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:50.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不带背包吗? - 谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Won't you be needing this? - Thanks. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:55.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是我爸爸 奥诺曼 - 我常听到你的大名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is my father, Norman Osborn.  - I've heard so much about you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:59.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很荣幸认识您 - 哈利说你对科学颇有研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's an honor, sir.  - Harry says you're a science whiz. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也算是科学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm something of a scientist myself. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:05.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拜读过您那有关纳米的科研报告 真的很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read your research on nanotechnology. Brilliant. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看得懂吗? - 是的 我还写了份报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You understood it? - Yes, I wrote a paper on it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真令人钦佩 你爸妈一定以你这天才为傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive. Your parents must be very proud. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:16.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我和叔叔婶婶住 - 你们两个 我们走吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I live with my aunt and uncle.  - Hey, you two! Let's move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 幸会了 - 希望能再见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice to meet you.  - Hope to see you again. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:26.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你爸爸人很好 - 只因你是个天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He doesn't seem so bad.  - Not if you're a genius. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看他很想领养你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he wants to adopt you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:33.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,世上有三万两千多种蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are over 32, 000 known species of spider in the world. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:37.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛目之下分为三大类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the order Araneae, divided into three suborders. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's amazing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是西岸最先进的电子显微镜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the most advanced electron microscope on the East Coast. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:45.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unreal. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:48.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有这些蜘蛛拥有不同的能力...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arachnids from all three groups possess...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:51.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助它们觅食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...varying strengths to help them search for food. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,例如这一种澳洲产的蜘蛛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For example, the Delena spider, family Sparassidae...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:07:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它有跳跃的能力去捕食猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has the ability to jump to catch its prey. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:02.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮校刊拍一张吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the school paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:12.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是古库基亚属的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next, we have the net web spider, family Filistatidae...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非里特帝科的结网蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...genus Kukulcania. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:18.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它能织出几乎跟...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spins a funnel-shaped web whose strands have a tensile strength...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.88,0:07:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,建筑用钢索一样强韧的漏斗状蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...proportionately equal to the high-tension wires used in bridges. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 离他远一点 - 不然会怎样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave him alone.  - Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不然的话他老爸就会开除你老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or his father will fire your father. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你老爸能怎样对付我? 控告我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Daddy gonna do? Sue me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:35.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁再多说话我就给他不合格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next person who talks will fail this course. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:40.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这种蜘蛛利用... - 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This spider... - Let's go. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:44.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反射动作猎食 它的反射神经反应非常快...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hunts using reflexes with nerve-conduction velocity so fast...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很多研究员认为它们有预知能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that some researchers believe it borders on precognition. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 能提早知道危险 - 怪人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An early awareness of danger.  - Jerks. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛第六感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A spider-sense. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看那只蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look at that spider. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:59.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些蜘蛛会随着环境变色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some spiders change colors to blend into their environment. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一种防御机制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a defense mechanism. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 谁想知道这些?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, what makes you think I'd want to know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:06.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁不想呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wouldn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:10.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这五年来 哥伦比亚大学研究中心...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over five painstaking years, Columbia's research facility.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:15.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要去找她聊天? - 不要啦 你去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gonna talk to her now? - Oh, no. Come on. You talk to her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:20.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有了这些DNA的基因蓝图 将以往不可能的都变成真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}With these DNA blueprints, we have begun what was once thought impossible. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:24.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好恶心 - 是啊 真恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Disgusting.  - Yeah, hateful little things. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, me too. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:32.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 蜘蛛能改变颜色...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, spiders can change their color...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:36.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 以融入自然环境 - 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to blend into their environment.  - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是一种防御机制 - 真酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it's a defense mechanism.  - Cool. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用合成的核糖核酸去制造全新基因组...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}transfer RNA to encode an entirely new genome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再跟三种蜘蛛的基因结合在一起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...combining the genetic information from all three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:52.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做出这15只超级蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into these 15 genetically designed super-spiders. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.77,0:08:54.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有14只{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 14. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有一只不见了? - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One's missing.  - Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜有研究人员拿走了它做实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess the researchers are working on that one. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:09.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是西岸最大的电子显微镜吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know that this is the largest electron microscope on the East Coast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:13.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在介绍时 你一直唠叨个不停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were talking throughout that woman's entire presentation. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们谈谈该如何留心倾听...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk about listening. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:24.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道在私立学校是怎么样的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what it's like at those fancy private schools...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在市公立高中...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but at Midtown High.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能拍张照片吗? 我要拍一张有学生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I take your picture? I need one with a student in it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然可以 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure.  - Great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我站哪儿? 这儿吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you want me? Over here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:46.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别把我拍得太难看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me look ugly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:57.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太完美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:06.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好吗? - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that good? - Great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:13.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}M.J., let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下... 谢谢!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Thanks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:41.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派克 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker, let's do it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(新品种){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(奥氏企业){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:11:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们解决了平行滑翔和重力平衡的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've solved the horizon glide and the balance issues. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:04.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过滑翔翼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already seen the glider. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.17,0:11:06.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为了这件事而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what I'm here for. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:09.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索将军 很高兴再见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Slocum, good to see you again. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴先生 费先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Balkan, Mr. Fargas. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:14.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 诺曼 - 奥斯本先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Norman.  - Mr. Osborn. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴董事会能大驾光临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always a pleasure to have our board of directors visit. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:21.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看体能增强计划的报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the report on human performance enhancers. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:26.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让白老鼠接受汽化吸入测试 它们的体能增强了八倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We tried vapor inhalation with rats. Their strength increased by 800%. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太棒了 - 有副作用吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excellent.  - Any side effects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:29.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:32.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其它的测试都很成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the tests since have been successful. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:36.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个出错的试验中 有什么副作用?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the trial that went wrong, what were the side effects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,暴力倾向 具有侵略性...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violence, aggression...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有疯狂状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and insanity. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有什么建议? - 那只是一次测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you recommend? - That was only one test. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:47.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了史博士以外 大家都担保...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for Dr. Stromm, our staff certifies the product...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:51.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以进行人体实验 - 史博士?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...ready for human testing.  - Dr. Stromm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须把整个研究退回到方程式阶段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to take the whole line back to formula. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 退回到方程式阶段重新开始? - 奥斯本博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Back to formula? - Dr. Osborn. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老实跟你说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be frank with you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未支持过你的计划 那是前任负责人批准的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never supported your program. We have my predecessor to thank for that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:10.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索将军将支持探索航太公司...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The general has approved Quest Aerospace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:13.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,制造人型盔甲的原型{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to build a prototype of their exoskeleton. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:17.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 两星期后进行测试 - 如果你所谓的体能增强计划...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They test in two weeks.  - And if your performance enhancers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.98,0:12:22.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到那时候人体实验还不成功...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...have not had a successful human trial by that date...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就撤销你的研究经费 转给别人做...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm gonna pull your funding. I'm going to give it to them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:30.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen. Ladies. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:40.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝说 来点光吧 马上就有光亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Lord said, "Let there be light. "And voila! There is light. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,40瓦特柔和的灯光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty soft, glowing watts of it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:48.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子 上帝是会很高兴 不过小心别摔倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy. God will be thrilled. Just don't fall on your ass. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:50.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经倒下了 梅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already on my ass, May. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:54.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个当了35年的资深技师都被裁员了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the plant's senior electrician is laid off after 35 years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:58.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这还能算什么? 我可是摔到谷底了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what would you call it? I am on my ass. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:01.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把绿色的盘子递给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand me that dish. The green one. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:04.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,企业目前都在裁员...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The corporation is downsizing the people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:06.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以求增加盈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and upsizing their profits. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,班 你会找到工作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Ben, you'll get another job somewhere. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 看看报纸上有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's look in the paper and see. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:17.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有征人广告 看看有什么工作?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are the want ads. What do we got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:19.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电脑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电脑销售员 电脑工程师 电脑分析师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Computer salesman, computer engineer, computer analyst. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 现在连分析师都要懂电脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord, even the computers need analysts these days. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.15,0:13:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都68岁 老了才学电脑太难... 而且还要维持家计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 68. I'm too old for computers, and besides, I have a family to provide for. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:35.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 彼得也爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. And Peter loves you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:39.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过最尽责的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the most responsible man I've ever known. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:44.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也苦过呀 还不是撑过来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been down-and-out before. But somehow, we survive. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:49.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子 你正好赶上... 赶上晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, sweetie. You're just... just in time for dinner. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:52.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧? 课外活动如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing? How was the field trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:55.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不舒服 我先去睡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel well. I'm gonna go to sleep. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不吃一点吗? - 我吃过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You won't have a bite? - Had a bite. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:00.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你有拍照吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get some pictures, Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.98,0:14:04.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要睡了 我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta crash. Everything's fine. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底是怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:30.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this recombination lab...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:35.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用合成的核糖核酸去制造全新基因组...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we use synthesized transfer RNA to encode an entirely new genome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:38.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再跟三种蜘蛛的基因结合在一起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...combining the genetic information from all three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:43.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做出这15只超级蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into these 15 genetically designed super-spiders. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:15:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥博士 求求你 体能增强计划还没完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Osborn, please. The performance enhancers aren't ready. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:05.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次实验结果并不成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The data just doesn't justify this test. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:09.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最后一次请求你 我们不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm asking you for the last time. We can't do this. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:11.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这么胆小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a coward. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实验本来就有风险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Risks are part of laboratory science. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:18.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我再另外安排一个医疗人员和自愿者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me reschedule, with a medical staff and a volunteer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:21.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只要给我两星期 - 两星期?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just give me two weeks.  - Two weeks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两星期内 我们拿不到合约 奥氏企业就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In two weeks? We'll have lost the contract to Quest and OSCORP will be dead. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你只能靠自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you gotta do things yourself. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给我催化剂 - 做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me the Promachloraperazine.  - For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它能让增强剂更快进入血液{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It begins catalyzation when the vapor hits the bloodstream. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:40.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类演化了四万年...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}40, 000 years of evolution...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:44.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无穷的潜力都还没完全发挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we've barely tapped the vastness of human potential. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 真冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's cold. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺曼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Norman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,诺曼!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Norman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊! 诺曼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! Norman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:42.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回到方程式重新开始?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to formula?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:30.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 彼得? - 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Peter? - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:33.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:40.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好一点吗? 有改变吗? - 改变?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any better this morning? Any change? - Change?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有很大的改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Big change. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:47.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快一点 我们快迟到了 - 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, hurry up. You'll be late.  - Right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:15.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真是的! - 我以为你生病了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodness me! - Jeez. I thought you were sick. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我好多了 - 看到了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got better.  - See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:21.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见了 - 你有带你的午餐钱吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, guys.  - Have you got your lunch money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:24.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了下课后要回来粉刷厨房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget, we're painting the kitchen after school. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:27.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好呀 班叔叔 我回来前别开始啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Uncle Ben. Don't start without me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别放我鸽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't start up with me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:35.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,年青人的荷尔蒙作祟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teenagers. Raging hormones. They never change. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:40.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是废物 你永远都是废物 跟你妈一样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trash! You're always gonna be trash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:44.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要去上学了 - 谁不让你去上学?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have to go to school.  - Who's stopping you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:03.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, M.J.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:10.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不知道 我从6岁起就是你的邻居{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you realize this, but we've been neighbors since I was 6. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.05,0:20:13.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想... 我可以跟你约会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was wondering if we could get together sometime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:15.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有车 上来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got the car. Hop in. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:18.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一起出去玩玩? 我不确定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do something fun? Or, I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:22.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得是多彼此了解的时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it'd be time to get to know each other. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:23.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要也行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:32.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 巴士满了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Parker, the bus is full!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:36.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 停车! - 坐出租车吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop the bus! - Catch a cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:38.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫他停车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him to stop. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:40.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看! - 白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Check him out! - Dork!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.64,0:21:06.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你躺在地上干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing on the floor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你整晚都躺在地上吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been there all night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:22.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night I was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我忘了 - 奥斯本先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't remember.  - Mr. Osborn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:31.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我叫她等一下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I asked her to wait. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我父亲不舒服 - 奥先生 史博士死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My father's not feeling well - Mr. Osborn, Dr. Stromm is dead. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.77,0:21:36.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在实验室找到他的尸体 是谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They found his body in the lab. He's been murdered, sir. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.67,0:21:44.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 还有飞行衣和滑翔翼...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - And the flight suit and the glider.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:46.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么样? - 被偷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about it? - Stolen, sir. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.17,0:22:14.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇! 好快的反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Great reflexes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:17.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢啦 - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks.  - No problem. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:22.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你原来有蓝眼珠 戴了眼镜都没有注意到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you have blue eyes. I didn't notice without your glasses. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,换了隐形眼镜吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just get contacts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, see you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 他真奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - He's freaking weird. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.07,0:23:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:24.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打起来了! - 你觉得很好玩?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a fight! - Think you're funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.11,0:24:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 只是个意外 - 我打掉你牙齿也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was an accident.  - So is my breaking your teeth. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 费许 住手 - 我不想跟你打架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flash, stop.  - I don't want to fight you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.28,0:24:08.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也不想和你打 - 揍他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wouldn't want to fight me neither.  - Kick his ass. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.57,0:24:28.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 快帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him, Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.85,0:24:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么做到的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.45,0:24:36.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该帮谁呀?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:38.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己来吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all yours, man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.77,0:24:55.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,费许 起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash, get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.10,0:25:00.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 派克 你真是怪胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Parker, you are a freak. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:04.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是惊人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was amazing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:07.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out of here. Come on. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.75,0:26:53.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去 网子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, web!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.42,0:26:56.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.56,0:27:00.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,射网!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up, up and away, web. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.26,0:27:03.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,变身!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shazam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.26,0:27:04.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呀 吐丝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.73,0:27:06.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吐丝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, web, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.63,0:27:41.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冲啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tallyho. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.37,0:28:25.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(天才 饭菜在烤箱里){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.31,0:28:28.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她啤酒买回来了吗? - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she back with the beer yet? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要啤酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me some beer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:32.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你自己去买 - 我可是付了钱...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up off your ass.  - I paid for beer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:33.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要叫! - 停!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop yelling.  - Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.95,0:28:36.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟你妈一样蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're as stupid as your mother. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.16,0:28:41.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's she going? Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.83,0:28:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没洗盘子 盘子总要有人洗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dishes aren't done. Somebody's gotta do dishes. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.37,0:28:48.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么不自己洗? - 给我过来洗盘子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you do them? - Get in here and do the dishes. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:53.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你自己吃的自己洗 - 我要出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do them. They're yours, anyway.  - I'm going out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.21,0:28:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你都听到了吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Were you listening to that? - No. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:59.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恩 我听到了 但我只是在倒垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I heard, but I was just taking out the trash. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你都听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you can always hear us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每家人都会有吵架时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody shouts. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.15,0:29:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叔叔婶婶就不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your aunt and uncle don't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.42,0:29:10.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 他们有时也吵得蛮大声的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they can scream pretty good sometimes. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.42,0:29:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天在学校跟费许的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, M.J., about today at school with Flash...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.93,0:29:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓死我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really freaked us out. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.73,0:29:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 他没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Is he okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:24.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很高兴你没有给他一个黑眼圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just happy you didn't give him a black eye for graduation. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.37,0:29:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你毕业后要去哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where are you going after you graduate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:38.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要搬进城里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna move into the city. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.55,0:29:43.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能当个摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And hopefully, get a job as a photographer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.52,0:29:46.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一边工作一边上大学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work my way through college. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.33,0:29:48.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.86,0:29:51.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要进城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Headed for the city too. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.56,0:29:54.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及要离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't wait to get out of here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.97,0:29:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:29:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.08,0:30:04.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, come on. Try me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.24,0:30:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:09.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在舞台上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...act...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.38,0:30:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,演戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on-stage. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.39,0:30:14.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.59,0:30:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's perfect. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.99,0:30:19.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在学校话剧演出中都很出色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were awesome in all the school plays. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:22.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗? - 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.43,0:30:25.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你演灰姑娘时 我哭得一塌糊涂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cried like a baby when you played Cinderella. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.90,0:30:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 那已是一年级的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, that was first grade. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.60,0:30:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:32.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even so. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.14,0:30:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.91,0:30:37.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you know people. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.71,0:30:42.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们以后会做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can just see what's coming. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.42,0:30:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会做什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see coming for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.69,0:30:52.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.69,0:30:59.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么 是我从未感觉过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it's something I never felt before. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:06.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.84,0:31:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会成为大明星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna light up Broadway. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:14.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.85,0:31:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你比实际上看起来高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're taller than you look. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.62,0:31:23.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我驼背{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hunch. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.36,0:31:27.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再驼背了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.46,0:31:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉! 来试坐我的生日礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, M.J.! Come take a ride in my new birthday present. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.07,0:31:36.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:39.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.61,0:31:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.47,0:31:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 天啊 好漂亮! - 对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God, it's gorgeous! - Yeah, right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.28,0:31:46.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看看他 - 上车吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at it! - Hop in. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 好酷的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. What a cool car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.98,0:31:50.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty tight, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:55.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下听听他的音响 嘿 别刮到皮垫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till you hear the sound system. Hey, don't scratch the leather. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.02,0:31:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酷车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool car. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:32:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(价格合理的中古车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.59,0:32:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(宾士 凯迪拉克轿车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.80,0:32:04.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(捷豹 保时捷跑车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:07.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(汽车城二手车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.57,0:32:10.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(你最佳的选择!){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.14,0:32:12.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(胜利TR-3){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.57,0:32:14.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(爱快罗密欧跑车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(敞篷跑车){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(征业余挥角选手 上场三分钟){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:23.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(三千元 个性必须乐观 ){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.96,0:32:31.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(装束之选择){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(工具皮带?){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.17,0:32:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(标志?){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.34,0:32:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(颜色要鲜艳一点){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.05,0:33:33.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:36.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在健身 我没穿衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm exercising. I'm not dressed, Aunt May. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:39.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近怪怪的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're acting so strangely, Peter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.99,0:33:42.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 谢谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thanks. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.74,0:33:53.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(奥氏企业面临危机){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.24,0:33:58.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(奥诺曼会一蹶不振吗?){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.89,0:34:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定有烦恼 他可能不好意思说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong. Maybe he's too embarrassed to tell me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.43,0:34:19.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不好意思问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'm too embarrassed to ask him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.90,0:34:22.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't know anymore. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.37,0:34:25.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去图书馆 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to the library. See you later. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.14,0:34:28.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 我载你去 - 不用了 我坐地铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. I'll drive you there.  - I'll take the train. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.67,0:34:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得去透透气 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I need the exercise. Go on. Go, go. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:46.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 多谢了 班叔叔 - 等一下 我们得谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for the ride, Uncle Ben.  - Wait. We need to talk. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.56,0:34:51.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 以后再谈吧 - 如果你愿意 我们现在就谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can talk later.  - Well, we can talk now. lf you let me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.86,0:34:54.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要谈什么? 一定要现在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we have to talk about? Why now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.27,0:34:58.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们好久没谈心了 我们都搞不懂你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't talked for so long. May and I don't know who you are. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.47,0:35:03.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不肯做家务 在房间里做一些怪实验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shirk your chores. You have all those weird experiments in your room. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在学校里打架 - 我说过不是我挑起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You start fights at school.  - I told you I didn't start that fight. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.98,0:35:11.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不是打赢了吗? - 我应该逃跑吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure finished it.  - Was I supposed to run away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.22,0:35:14.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该逃 只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not supposed to run away, but.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.35,0:35:19.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在改变 在你这个年纪 我也一样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're changing. I went through exactly the same thing at your age. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:21.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 太不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not exactly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.46,0:35:25.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这几年的转变...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the years when a man changes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.33,0:35:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将决定未来你是怎么样的一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into the man he's gonna become the rest of his life. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.50,0:35:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心别误入歧途{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be careful who you change into. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.14,0:35:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个和你打架的人 也许是他错他活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy, Flash Thompson, he probably deserved what happened. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:42.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你打了他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just because you can beat him up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.35,0:35:45.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不代表你就是对 有权去打他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...doesn't give you the right to. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.32,0:35:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住: 能力愈大 责任愈重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, with great power comes great responsibility. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.09,0:35:56.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕我变成流泯吗? 别瞎担心了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you afraid I'll become a criminal? Quit worrying about me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.30,0:36:00.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情不一样 我自己会解决的 别跟我说教{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's different. I'll figure it out. Stop lecturing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.00,0:36:04.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟你说教 我也不是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean to lecture or preach. And I know I'm not your father. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.37,0:36:07.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就别充父亲样子来说教!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then stop pretending to be!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.31,0:36:12.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.51,0:36:17.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我十点来接你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pick you up here at 10. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.70,0:36:57.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巨无霸...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bone Saw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.82,0:36:59.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(巨无霸: 灾难之王){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.26,0:37:03.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 1 2 3 结束 - 谁是第一名?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One, two, three. That's it! - Who's the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.43,0:37:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen...{\r}
