Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.99,0:48:07.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有给我叔叔机会吗? 你有吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about my uncle? Did you give him a chance? Did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.56,0:48:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回答我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.46,0:48:14.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拦住他!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that guy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.24,0:48:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.85,0:48:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.64,0:48:57.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站住 你被团团包围了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze! We've got the place completely surrounded. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.65,0:49:42.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. My God. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.12,0:49:48.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 不 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Oh, my God. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.20,0:49:54.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(探索航太第六测试场){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.20,0:49:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 将军 很高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening.  - General. Good to see you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.97,0:50:03.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行衣的火力强大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our exoskeleton's got real firepower, general. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.01,0:50:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果真像你说的那么好 我马上签合约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if it does what you say it can, I'll sign that contract tomorrow. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.91,0:50:12.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备起飞 - 你对这测试很有信心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's clear! Go! - You're confident about this test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.88,0:50:15.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 寇上尉是顶尖飞行员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. Curtis is our top pilot. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.92,0:50:18.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥氏企业怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what about your commitment to OSCORP?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:23.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常乐意让奥氏关门大吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing would please me more than to put Osborn out of business. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.10,0:50:28.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,飞行前检查完毕 起飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preflight complete. Mark. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.24,0:50:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不明物体快速接近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unidentified object is closing fast. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.04,0:50:36.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.31,0:50:38.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.24,0:50:40.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.89,0:50:53.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说"茄子"  - 茄子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say "chess. "   - Chess!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.22,0:50:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.33,0:51:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 我真为你骄傲 你今天看起来好帅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, I'm so proud of you. You looked so handsome up there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.07,0:51:03.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸在纽约找到地方 到秋天时就可搬过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad got the place in New York, so we're all set for fall. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.74,0:51:05.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太好了 - 你毕业了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great! - You made it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.04,0:51:11.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我第一次走眼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the first time I've been proven wrong. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.78,0:51:15.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 恭喜 - 谢了 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Congratulations.  - Thanks, Dad. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.38,0:51:18.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你得到科学奖 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, the science award. That's terrific. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.42,0:51:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.69,0:51:26.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道最近对你来说很难受...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this has been a difficult time for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.16,0:51:29.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我要你好好享受今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I want you to try to enjoy this day. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.66,0:51:31.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毕业典礼...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencement:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.36,0:51:35.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这代表一个新的开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end of one thing, the start of something new. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.30,0:51:40.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你分手 这是你的戒指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be with you anymore. Here's your ring. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.99,0:51:44.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗? 随便你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Whatever. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.28,0:51:46.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的损失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your loss. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.44,0:51:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟哈利情同手足 所以我们是一家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like a brother to Harry. That makes you family. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.18,0:51:54.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有需要就找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you ever need anything, give me a call. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.90,0:52:10.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I fix you something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.30,0:52:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.55,0:52:59.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天很想念他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed him a lot today. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.39,0:53:03.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.59,0:53:06.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也很想他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss him too. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.16,0:53:10.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过他今天也在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.70,0:53:19.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不由自主地想到我对他说的最后一句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help thinking about the last thing I said to him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.20,0:53:24.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想教我善恶之分... 可我却不理他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to tell me something important, and I threw it in his face. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.88,0:53:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很爱他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You loved him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.65,0:53:32.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他也很爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he loved you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.82,0:53:36.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直都相信你会成材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never doubted the man you'd grow into. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.59,0:53:40.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也会做出一番大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you were meant for great things. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.56,0:53:43.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会让他失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't disappoint him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.46,0:54:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能力愈大 责任愈重...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}With great power comes great responsibility. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.83,0:54:24.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要牢牢记住!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that, Pete. Remember that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.00,0:54:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快一点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.62,0:54:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(蒙面人阻止抢劫案){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.63,0:54:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是人 我哥哥看到他在林肯中心吐蜘蛛网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a man. My brother saw him build a nest in Lincoln Center. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.60,0:54:54.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他是人 是个男人 搞不好是女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's human, a man. Could be a woman. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.97,0:54:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(我们收购钻石){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.90,0:55:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴比 你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby. Get a load of this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.81,0:55:09.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一扬手就吐出丝 然后他就在上面爬行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He throws up his hands, ropes come out, and he climbs up them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.38,0:55:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他的蜘蛛网 他的标志 我就知道蜘蛛侠出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the web, his signature, and I know Spider-Man was here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.69,0:55:16.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会保护我们 保护市民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy protects us, protects the people. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.49,0:55:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是疯子就是怪胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of freakyloo or something. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.36,0:55:21.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很臭而且我不喜欢他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stinks and I don't like him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.09,0:55:24.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动 小姐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move, lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.47,0:55:31.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(你的好邻居  蜘蛛侠上){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.80,0:55:34.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有八只手的男人 好性感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy with eight hands. Sounds hot. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.77,0:55:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的紧身裤还有那小小的紧身...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those tights and that tight little...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.10,0:55:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他打扮成蜘蛛 他看起来像昆虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dresses like a spider He looks like a bug{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.67,0:55:44.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都该为他加油打气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we should all just give him One big hug{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.61,0:55:49.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 蜘蛛侠来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out Here comes the Spider-Man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.85,0:55:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"谁是蜘蛛侠? "只是个罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Who is Spider-Man? "He's a criminal, that's who he is. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.79,0:56:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个公害 怎么会上我的头版封面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vigilante, a public menace. Why's he on my front page?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.93,0:56:03.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹先生 你太太在一线 她想知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jameson, your wife needs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.61,0:56:06.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 第六版有问题 - 头版才有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a page six problem.  - We have a page one problem. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.80,0:56:08.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么? - 他是热门新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well? - He's news. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.40,0:56:11.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 客户不能等 - 让他们等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The clients can't wait.  - They're about to. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.07,0:56:14.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在地铁救了六个人 - 也许是他造成的灾难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He pulled six people off a subway.  - From a wreck he probably caused. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.26,0:56:19.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿出事他就会在那儿 看! 他看来像在逃离现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something goes wrong and he's there. Look! He's fleeing the scene. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.60,0:56:23.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他救了其它人 是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's probably going to save somebody else. He's a hero!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.72,0:56:26.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那干么他要带面具 为什么要藏头露尾?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why the mask? What's he got to hide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.62,0:56:29.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她想要知道要用绵布还是绒布{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needs to know if you want chintz or chenille. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.85,0:56:32.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 用便宜的那一个 - 是这样的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whichever's cheaper.  - It's like this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.52,0:56:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第六版的版面被重复预定了 梅西百货和大卖场都要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We double-booked page six. Macy's and Conway's both have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.53,0:56:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们卖光4版? - 卖光?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We sold out four printings.  - Sold out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.83,0:56:41.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每一份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every copy. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.83,0:56:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天头版要登蜘蛛侠照片 大卖场广告放到第七版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, Spider-Man, page one. Move Conway to page seven. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.60,0:56:48.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 第七版放不下 - 那放第八版吧 打九折 还是打九五折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a problem.  - Then make it page eight. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.67,0:56:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 办不到 - 给我滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That can't be done.  - Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.54,0:56:55.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有蜘蛛侠的照片 艾迪跟了半天 什么也拍不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't get a decent picture. Eddie's on it, but we can barely see him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.60,0:56:57.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么 他害羞吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, what is he, shy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.82,0:57:02.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们可以拍到朱莉亚·罗伯茨的裸照 我们也可以拍到这个怪胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can get Julia Roberts in a thong, we can get this weirdo. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.02,0:57:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,登广告说: 拍到蜘蛛侠就有奖金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the front page: "Cash for a Spider-Man picture. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.62,0:57:09.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不想成名 我就让他声名狼籍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't want to be famous? I'll make him infamous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.28,0:57:12.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(月舞快餐){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.57,0:57:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzz off. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.67,0:57:27.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛莉 是我 彼得 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- M.J., it's me, Peter.  - Hi!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.15,0:57:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.95,0:57:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在找工作 你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begging for a job. How about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.78,0:57:37.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我正要去试镜 - 试镜? 你在演戏了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm headed to an audition.  - An audition? So you're acting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.72,0:57:38.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.96,0:57:42.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到一份工作 刚下班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work steady. In fact, I just got off a job. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.99,0:57:44.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.76,0:57:48.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的美梦成真了 - 大明星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're doing it. Living your dream.  - Glamour girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.13,0:57:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的收银机抽屉少了六块钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your drawer was short $6!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.93,0:57:52.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下次要扣薪水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, I'll take it from your check. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.64,0:57:57.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 华小姐? 我在跟你讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Miss Watson? I'm talking to you! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.64,0:58:00.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 恩瑞! 好啦 我听到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Enrique! Okay? I get you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.14,0:58:04.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下次小心点 最好不要再发生了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better not happen no more. Don't roll your eyes at me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.22,0:58:13.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梦想... 嗯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some dream, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.79,0:58:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么好丢脸的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing to be embarrassed about. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.39,0:58:19.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别告诉哈利 - 别告诉哈利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't tell Harry.  - Don't tell Harry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.60,0:58:24.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是住在一起吗? 我们正在约会 他没告诉你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you guys live together? We're going out. Didn't he tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.60,0:58:26.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 对!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.84,0:58:29.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他讨厌我当服务生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he'd hate the idea of my waiting tables. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.87,0:58:34.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他觉得那有点低贱 - 那不是低贱 是份正当工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'd think it was low or something.  - It's not low. You have a job. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.88,0:58:39.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 哈利并不是活在现实世界里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Harry doesn't live on a little place I like to call Earth. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.75,0:58:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I guess not. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.89,0:58:48.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 彼特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Pete. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:52.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们改天再聚聚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should catch up sometime. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.03,0:58:59.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找个晚上来吃午餐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get some lunch some evening. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.14,0:59:04.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,改天我会来找你!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll come by and have some of your Moondance coffee some day. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.84,0:59:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不会告诉哈利 - 别告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I won't tell Harry.  - Don't tell Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.81,0:59:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.12,0:59:13.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会告诉哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.50,0:59:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间太完美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timing's perfect. Hey. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.16,0:59:30.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五份新合约 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five new contracts. It'll be great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.60,0:59:35.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸又来巡视了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Norman's making his weekly inspection. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.11,0:59:38.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过大半的时间花在电话上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spent half of it on the phone. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.94,0:59:44.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你在这 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, I'm glad you're here. I need your help. I'm really lost here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.45,0:59:46.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.08,0:59:52.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来像是在科学比赛惨败 屈居第二名的鬼样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you just got second place in the science fair. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.94,0:59:56.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我上班迟到 结果被康博士开除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was late for work and Dr. Connors fired me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.03,0:59:58.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又迟到了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were late again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.23,1:00:02.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白  你到底跑哪儿去了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it. Where do you go all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.37,1:00:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到处走走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Around. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.80,1:00:05.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Parker. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.84,1:00:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许你该告诉我她是谁 - 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe you'll tell me who she is.  - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.51,1:00:11.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈利正在约会的神秘女郎 - 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This mystery girl Harry's been dating.  - Dad. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.98,1:00:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候我可以见他?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I get to meet her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.83,1:00:17.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 哈利没提过她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sorry. Harry hasn't mentioned her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.95,1:00:23.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 你正在找新工作吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pete, you're probably looking for a job now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.45,1:00:26.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 也许你能帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, maybe you can help him out. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.46,1:00:30.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不用了 我自己找 - 我可以打几个电话搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I appreciate it, but I'll be fine.  - I'll make a few calls. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.96,1:00:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能接受 我想自食其力 自己找工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't accept it. I like to earn what I get. I'll find work. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.47,1:00:37.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很佩服你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respect that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.77,1:00:40.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想靠自己打天下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to make it on your own. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.57,1:00:42.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.77,1:00:45.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还有什么才能?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What other skills do you have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.34,1:00:47.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想当摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking about photography. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.63,1:00:49.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(悬赏! 蜘蛛侠照片){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.41,1:00:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.55,1:00:56.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上吧 快!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.05,1:00:59.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着街上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the street!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.14,1:01:15.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笑一个!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.42,1:01:25.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're crap. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.92,1:01:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾... 全是垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap, crap. Megacrap. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.09,1:01:32.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我给你两百元 - 价钱有点低啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll give you $200.  - That seems a little low. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.52,1:01:34.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就去找别人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them somewhere else. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.66,1:01:39.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你太太说你订的磁砖缺货 - 那就铺地毯吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your wife says the tile's out of stock.  - We'll put a rug there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.13,1:01:41.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下 给我看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down. Give me that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.67,1:01:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你三百元 这是标准价格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give you 300. That's the standard fee. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.40,1:01:48.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把照片刊在头版 - 标题呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scrap page one. Run that.  - Headline?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.04,1:01:51.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠: 英雄还是公害? 号角日报独家照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Spider-Man, Hero or Menace? Exclusive Photos. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.41,1:01:54.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 公害? 他在保护... - 你拍照就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Menace? He was protecting - You take the photos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.77,1:01:57.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我负责想标题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll make up the headlines. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.55,1:01:59.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 先生 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, sir.  - Goody. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.02,1:02:03.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到柜台 她会付你钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give this to the girl up front. She'll see you get paid. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.98,1:02:06.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想要一份正职工作 - 你只能当特聘兼职摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd like a job, sir.  - No jobs. Freelance. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.98,1:02:08.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对你最好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best thing for you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.83,1:02:13.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要拍到那个跳梁小丑 我就付你钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring me more shots of that clown, maybe I'll buy them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.33,1:02:16.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我没说要给你工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I never said you have a job. Meat. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.47,1:02:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最多在新年送你一串腊肠 快给我更多的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send you a box of Christmas meat. Bring me more photos. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.34,1:02:23.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好 - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi.  - Hi. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.77,1:02:27.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,詹先生要我给你这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jameson told me to give that to you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.31,1:02:31.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 欢迎来到号角日报 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to the Daily Bugle.  - Thank you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.92,1:02:33.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是彼得·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Peter Parker. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.79,1:02:38.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a photographer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.79,1:02:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I can see that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.03,1:02:51.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从今天起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.04,1:02:55.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥氏企业超越探索航太...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...OSCORP Industries has surpassed Quest Aerospace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.31,1:02:59.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成为美国军方的最大供应商{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as the principal supplier to the United States military. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.90,1:03:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 各位董事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In short, ladies and gentlemen of the board...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.90,1:03:06.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成本降低 利润增加...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...costs are down, revenues are up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.28,1:03:09.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们公司的股价 则前所未见的涨高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and our stock has never been higher. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.29,1:03:14.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实在太好了 所以我们决定要把公司卖掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful news, Norman. That's why we're selling the company. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.56,1:03:16.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.03,1:03:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,探索航太目前正在集资扩大规模{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quest is recapitalizing in the wake of the bombing. Expanding. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.40,1:03:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们开出来的收购条件很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made a tender offer we can't ignore. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.34,1:03:25.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不知会我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why wasn't I told?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.67,1:03:30.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不希望引起资深管理阶层斗争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't want a power struggle with entrenched management. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.04,1:03:32.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在的话 收购交易就拉倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The deal is off if you come with it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.51,1:03:36.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会将在30天内宣布联署罢免你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The board expects your resignation in 30 days. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.18,1:03:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do this to me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.22,1:03:43.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这公司是我一手创立的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I started this company. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.59,1:03:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我为此牺牲了多少吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how much I sacrificed? !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.86,1:03:56.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 麦克斯 - 诺曼 董事会已一致通过罢免你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Max. Please.  - Norman, the board is unanimous. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.87,1:04:01.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将选在世界嘉年华会之后宣布{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're announcing the sale after the World Unity Festival. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.04,1:04:02.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.54,1:04:06.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你出局了 诺曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out, Norman. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.52,1:04:17.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.81,1:04:24.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到探索航太的世界嘉年华会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to OSCORP Industries Unity Day Festival. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.43,1:04:26.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请鼓掌欢迎梅西·格蕾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hear it for Macy Gray. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.70,1:04:35.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约市民惊恐蜘蛛之吻){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.17,1:05:08.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 你怎么不穿黑色礼服?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}M.J., why didn't you wear the black dress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.77,1:05:12.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要让我爸爸有好印象 他喜欢黑色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just, I wanted to impress my father. He loves black. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.61,1:05:17.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我穿什么他都喜欢 至少你觉得我很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe he'll be impressed no matter what. You think I'm pretty. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.65,1:05:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're beautiful. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.86,1:05:36.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的酒忘了放在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my drink inside. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.38,1:05:48.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 费先生 - 嗨 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, hi, Mr. Fargas.  - Oh, Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.58,1:05:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看到我爸爸吗? - 他今天不一定会来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you seen my father? - Well, I'm not sure if he's coming. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.73,1:06:09.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是什么? - 一定是今年的新玩意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - Must be new this year. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.10,1:06:15.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.57,1:06:17.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们的滑降翼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our glider!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.85,1:06:29.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么玩意?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.71,1:06:59.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紧急状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.17,1:07:17.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喔 天啊 哈利! - 玛莉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! Harry! - M.J.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.31,1:07:27.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利 救救我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry! Help me! Harry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.72,1:07:34.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我出局了 是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out, am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.01,1:07:42.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛莉! - 哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mary Jane! - Harry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:46.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, my dear. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.13,1:07:49.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Spider-Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.51,1:08:02.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快走啊 - 比利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Move, kid.  - Billy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.92,1:08:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去救他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:13.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.06,1:08:17.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 站住! - 我投降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold it! - I surrender. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.63,1:08:20.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 喔! 糟了 - 不要动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, boy.  - Hold it right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.94,1:08:27.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.46,1:08:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛莉! - 救命啊 快来救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mary Jane! - Help! Someone please help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.26,1:09:22.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓稳了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.96,1:09:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.10,1:09:37.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet again, Spider-Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.39,1:10:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这比坐地铁快吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, beats taking the subway. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.29,1:10:28.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别理我们 她只是要用一下电梯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mind us. She just needs to use the elevator. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.69,1:10:29.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.99,1:10:31.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.43,1:10:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我是谁 - 我知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know who I am.  - I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.20,1:10:37.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的好邻居蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friendly neighborhood Spider-Man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.61,1:10:52.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议? 你说不可思议是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible? What do you mean he's incredible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.58,1:10:57.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 好吧 等一下 待在那里 我等一下就过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. All right, wait. Stay there. I'll come over. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.94,1:10:59.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就过去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm gonna come...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.94,1:11:03.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 明天一早能打给我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Fine. Will you call me in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.59,1:11:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起吃早饭...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll go and have breakfast and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.70,1:11:09.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想送你一些东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I want to buy you something. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.17,1:11:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想要 可以让你感觉好一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I want to. It'll make you feel better. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.54,1:11:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说不可思议是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. And what do you mean, incredible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.08,1:11:22.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 对不起 晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'm sorry. Sleep tight. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.63,1:11:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别做恶梦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the bedbugs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.09,1:11:33.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没事 只是受到惊吓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's all right. She's just a little rattled. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.76,1:11:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道早该跟你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Pete, I should have told you about us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.76,1:11:42.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道我喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you should know I'm crazy about her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.57,1:11:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你一直没有行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just, you know, you never made a move. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:48.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.14,1:11:51.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我没有行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.67,1:11:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去睡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get some rest. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.25,1:12:00.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我待会再睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna stay up for a while. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.62,1:12:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.94,1:12:05.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.72,1:12:10.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么 一定要阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, somebody has to stop it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.83,1:12:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.20,1:12:30.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.25,1:12:33.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁说的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.45,1:12:37.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别装一副无辜样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't play the innocent with me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.29,1:12:42.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've known all along. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.96,1:12:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.50,1:12:52.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着那股直冲你脑门的寒意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow the cold shiver running down your spine. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.44,1:13:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.03,1:13:04.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.98,1:13:08.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以为这全是巧合吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think it was coincidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.42,1:13:12.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你身上发生这么多好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many good things, all happening for you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.16,1:13:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这全是为了你 诺曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All for you. Norman. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.36,1:13:20.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.33,1:13:22.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说你不敢说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To say what you won't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.67,1:13:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做你不敢做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To do what you can't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.40,1:13:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除掉挡住你的每一个障碍...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To remove those in your way. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.97,1:13:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会委员们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The board members. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.15,1:13:38.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.72,1:13:40.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We killed them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.98,1:13:41.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.82,1:13:43.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.52,1:13:46.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在实验室的小意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your little accident in the laboratory. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.26,1:13:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,体能增强剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The performance enhancers. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.16,1:13:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答对了 就是我-你最伟大的发明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo. Me! Your greatest creation. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.57,1:13:59.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你这辈子最想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bringing you what you've always wanted:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.54,1:14:02.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,超乎想像的超能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power beyond your wildest dreams. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.57,1:14:05.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's only the beginning. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.58,1:14:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个人能阻止我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one who can stop us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.68,1:14:15.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他能加入我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or imagine if he joined us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.89,1:14:23.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠和绿恶魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man. And the Green Goblin. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.36,1:14:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绿恶魔 喜欢吗? 是我想出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Green Goblin. You like that? Made it up myself. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.80,1:14:29.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这些怪胎需要有个名字 - 詹先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These weirdos all got to have a name.  - Mr. Jameson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.97,1:14:32.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 霍夫曼! - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hoffman! - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.84,1:14:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,替"绿恶魔"申请版权 有人用这个名字就要付我钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copyright "Green Goblin. "I want a quarter every time it's said. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.81,1:14:39.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绿坏蛋如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about "Green Meanie"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.24,1:14:42.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠没有攻击别人 这是恶意中伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man wasn't attacking. That's slander. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.35,1:14:44.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 我不同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not. I resent that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.85,1:14:47.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中伤是说话 印出来就是毁谤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slander is spoken. In print, it's libel. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.82,1:14:49.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不相信任何人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't trust anybody. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.89,1:14:52.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我信任我的理发师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust my barber. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.52,1:14:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠的律师吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you his lawyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.22,1:14:59.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他告吧 大家都想发财 这让这个国家...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him sue. Get rich like a normal person. That's what made this country...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.47,1:15:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,姓詹的 你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jameson, you slime. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.84,1:15:13.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁拍到蜘蛛侠的照片?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who takes the pictures of Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.34,1:15:16.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不知道 他都用寄的 - 你骗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. His stuff comes by mail.  - Liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.45,1:15:19.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我发誓 - 他能带我找到蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I swear.  - He's the one who can bring me to him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.55,1:15:22.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道他是谁 - 你真没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know who he is.  - You are useless. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.69,1:15:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他放下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set him down, tough guy. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.22,1:15:29.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说来就来 - 我就知道你们是同党{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Speak of the devil.  - I knew you two were in this together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.99,1:15:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人说话 小孩不可插嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiddo, let Mom and Dad talk for a minute. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.80,1:15:35.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安睡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.77,1:15:53.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒来吧 小蜘蛛 醒来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, little spider. Wake up. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.88,1:15:58.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 你没死 还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not dead yet. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.52,1:16:00.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是暂时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just paralyzed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.89,1:16:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被麻痹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...temporarily. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.83,1:16:07.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很不可思议 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an amazing creature, Spider-Man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.13,1:16:10.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我是那么的相像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I are not so different. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.29,1:16:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你不同 你是个杀人凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not like you. You're a murderer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.83,1:16:16.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是人各有志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to each his own. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.90,1:16:20.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的选择 而你选择当超级英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose my path, you chose the way of the hero. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.52,1:16:25.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大众对你只有三分钟热度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they found you amusing for a while, the people of this city. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.31,1:16:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们最想看到的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the one thing they love more than a hero...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.78,1:16:32.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,英雄的失败 殒落和死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is to see a hero fail, fall, die trying. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.58,1:16:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你替他们做了多少好事 最后他们都只会憎恨你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In spite of everything you've done for them, eventually, they will hate you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.35,1:16:38.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那又何必呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why bother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.59,1:16:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 因为这是对的 - 事实是这样子的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because it's right.  - Here's the real truth. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.72,1:16:46.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约有八百万市民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are eight million people in this city. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.93,1:16:51.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的存在只有一个作用...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those teeming masses exist for the sole purpose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.43,1:16:55.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把少数杰出的天才举在他们肩上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of lifting the few exceptional people onto their shoulders. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.56,1:16:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像是你 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.50,1:16:59.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're exceptional. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.71,1:17:04.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我大可以一脚把你踩扁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could squash you like a bug right now. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.61,1:17:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我给你一个选择 加入我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm offering you a choice. Join me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.45,1:17:12.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一下我们可以共同完成的大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine what we could accomplish together. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.25,1:17:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以开创未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we could create. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.56,1:17:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是我们可以大肆破坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we could destroy. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.76,1:17:21.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你所谓的理想 死伤无辜百姓...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause the deaths of countless innocents in selfish battle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.90,1:17:27.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们双方倒下为止 这才是你想要的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...again and again and again until we're both dead. Is that what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.82,1:17:32.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看吧 大英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about it, hero. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.38,1:17:39.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(蜘蛛侠和绿恶魔狼狈为奸){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.77,1:17:41.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(全面通缉){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.65,1:17:49.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你替他们做了多少好事 最后他们都只会憎恨你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In spite of everything you've done for them, eventually, they will hate you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:51.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(市民呼吁当局扑灭害虫){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.33,1:18:01.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me again. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:02.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的试镜如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your audition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.82,1:18:05.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道? - 我的消息灵通 你妈妈...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you know? - The hot line. Your mom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.94,1:18:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我婶婶说的 婶婶跟我说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...told my aunt, told me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.34,1:18:09.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是来看我吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you just came by?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.88,1:18:13.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正好路过 想看一下可爱的面孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in the neighborhood. Needed to see a friendly face. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.71,1:18:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我坐公车和计程车大老远跑来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took two buses and a cab to get in the neighborhood, but.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.55,1:18:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,试镜如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.22,1:18:24.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我再回去上演技课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said I needed acting lessons. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.96,1:18:28.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肥皂剧要我去上演技课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soap opera told me I needed acting lessons. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.90,1:18:34.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我请你吃汉堡 价钱上限到7. 84元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me buy you a cheeseburger. The sky's the limit, up to $7. 84. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.59,1:18:38.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like a cheeseburger. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.07,1:18:41.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我要跟哈利约了吃晚饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, but I'm going out to dinner with Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.94,1:18:43.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一起来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.54,1:18:46.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 谢了 你们之间如何...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks. How's it going with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.25,1:18:51.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 不关我的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind. That's none of my business. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.25,1:18:53.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.15,1:18:56.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你干嘛这么关心?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why so interested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.49,1:18:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.26,1:19:00.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.26,1:19:04.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我干嘛要关心? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, why would I be? - I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.26,1:19:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.97,1:19:10.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, that's a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.49,1:19:12.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.14,1:19:17.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你不跟我们一起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry you won't come with us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.48,1:19:21.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd better run, tiger. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.16,1:19:32.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 看!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, check it out, man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.33,1:19:34.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别走 美女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.53,1:19:41.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪儿? 美女 来嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where you going, baby? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.69,1:20:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.45,1:20:35.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.76,1:20:42.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像有惹上麻烦的习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a knack for getting in trouble. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.33,1:20:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你也好像有救我的习惯 超级英雄来当我的保镖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a knack for saving my life. I think I have a superhero stalker. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.90,1:20:49.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚巧在附近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in the neighborhood. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.64,1:20:54.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are amazing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.21,1:20:57.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人不这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people don't think so. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.04,1:21:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你真的很棒 - 有仰慕者真好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you are.  - Nice to have a fan. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.78,1:21:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这次我能谢你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I get to say thank you this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.89,1:21:08.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.36,1:22:18.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要进去救我的孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me in! My baby's in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.69,1:22:20.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我进去! - 屋顶就快塌了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me go! - The roof's collapsing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.96,1:22:24.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁来救救我的孩子 - 屋顶就快塌了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Somebody save my baby! - The roof's about to collapse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.66,1:22:26.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.64,1:22:35.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请救救我的孩子!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save my baby, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.16,1:23:00.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.01,1:23:11.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事了 他很安全 - 我的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay. Your baby's fine.  - Oh, my baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.93,1:23:15.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝保佑你 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless you, Spider-Man. Bless you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.07,1:23:17.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别让他跑掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.01,1:23:20.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等! 你被捕了 我要带你回警局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! You're under arrest. I'm taking you in. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.44,1:23:24.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 还有人在上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, there's somebody still up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.14,1:23:27.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去救人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.15,1:23:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会等你回来 - 我不会再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll be here when you get back.  - Not coming back. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.65,1:23:33.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.66,1:23:44.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.40,1:23:47.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:55.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你救出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.34,1:23:59.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.95,1:24:08.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点新意也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pathetically predictable. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.69,1:24:11.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老是飞蛾扑火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a moth to the flame. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.42,1:24:14.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的提议怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about my generous proposal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.96,1:24:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想不想加入我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in or are you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.00,1:24:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我看你是丧心病狂了 - 答错了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's you who's out. Out of your mind.  - Wrong answer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.34,1:24:26.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.51,1:25:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人能拒绝我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one says no to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.65,1:25:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托你别闹了 可以吗? - 哈利 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- M.J., will you stop goofing around? - Harry, relax. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.52,1:25:22.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.59,1:25:24.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.93,1:25:28.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅婶 抱歉迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt May. I'm sorry I'm late. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.80,1:25:32.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,工作忙得要命 我带了水果蛋糕来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work was murder. I picked up a fruitcake. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.10,1:25:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 奥斯本先生 很高兴你抽空过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Osborn. We're so glad you could come. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.77,1:25:38.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这位可爱的小姐是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this lovely young lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.71,1:25:43.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我父亲奥诺曼 爸爸 这是华玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to meet my father. Dad, this is Mary Jane Watson. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.15,1:25:46.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我一直想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking forward to meeting you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.05,1:25:49.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 感恩节快乐 - 彼得呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy Thanksgiving, sir.  - Now, where is Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.95,1:25:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他最好记得买红莓酱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd better remember that cranberry sauce. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.06,1:26:02.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪 我不知道他在家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's weird. I didn't know he was here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.64,1:26:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.18,1:26:16.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.35,1:26:26.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪 没有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How strange. There's nobody here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.00,1:26:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他有点邋遢 不是吗? - 天才都是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bit of a slob, isn't he? - All brilliant men are. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.10,1:27:11.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大家好 - 彼得!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, everyone.  - Oh, Peter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.87,1:27:13.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外面真是混乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a jungle out there. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.80,1:27:18.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易才买到酱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to beat an old lady with a stick to get these cranberries. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.18,1:27:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 现在 请大家坐下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Now then, everybody sit down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.18,1:27:23.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们祷告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and we can say grace. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.03,1:27:38.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来了 - 看起来很好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There we are.  - It looks delicious. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.17,1:27:44.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你切火鸡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you do the honors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.15,1:27:59.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 彼特 你在流血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, Peter, you're bleeding. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.22,1:28:06.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我走在街上 被个骑脚踏车的撞伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stepped off a curb and got clipped by one of those bike messengers. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.72,1:28:08.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let me see. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.43,1:28:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my goodness. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.23,1:28:12.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看起来很严重 - 没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That looks awful.  - No, it's nothing. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.80,1:28:16.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿急救箱 接着再来祷告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the first-aid kit. Then we'll say grace. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.17,1:28:22.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们第一次在这儿过感恩节 我们要照规矩来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the boys' first Thanksgiving here, and we'll do things properly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.41,1:28:24.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么受伤的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you say that happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.91,1:28:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,骑脚踏车的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bike messenger. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.85,1:28:30.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我撞伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knocked me down. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.50,1:28:39.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不好意思 我得走了 - 为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you'll excuse me, I've got to go.  - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.97,1:28:43.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然想到一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something has come to my attention. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.54,1:28:45.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.04,1:28:49.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 谢谢你 大家慢用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine, just fine. Thank you, Mrs. Parker. Everyone. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.18,1:28:52.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 请享用水果蛋糕 - 爸爸!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enjoy the fruitcake.  - Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.72,1:28:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你多认识玛莉 但你现在却要离开?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I planned this so you'd meet M.J., and now you have to leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.72,1:28:59.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.73,1:29:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她对我很重要 - 拜托你看清楚一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This girl is important to me.  - Harry, please. Look at her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.06,1:29:08.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为她是真的喜欢你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think she's sniffing around because she likes your personality?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.30,1:29:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在说什么? - 你妈妈也很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you saying? - Your mother was beautiful. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.44,1:29:17.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她们都很漂亮 直到一闻到钱就变成豺狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all beautiful until they're snarling after your money like wolves. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.04,1:29:18.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你错了 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong, Dad. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.88,1:29:22.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你一个忠告怎对女友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A word to the not-so-wise about your girlfriend:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.25,1:29:26.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把她弄到手了就甩掉她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you need to with her, then broom her fast. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.56,1:29:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我辩解 哈利!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for sticking up for me, Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.27,1:29:42.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你都听到了? - 全部人都听到那混蛋说的话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You heard? - Everyone heard that creep. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.47,1:29:46.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可是我老爸 我只恨我什么也比不上他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That creep is my father. With luck, I'll be half of what he is. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.54,1:29:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂就别乱说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up about stuff you don't understand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.04,1:29:51.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry Osborn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.81,1:29:54.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Aunt May. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.82,1:30:00.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠是战无不胜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man is all but invincible. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.32,1:30:03.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们能毁了彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Parker, we can destroy him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.66,1:30:05.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.16,1:30:08.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不容许背叛的行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrayal must not be countenanced. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.43,1:30:11.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要给他一点教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker must be educated. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.83,1:30:14.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.37,1:30:18.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教教他什么是痛苦和失去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instruct him in the matters of loss and pain. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.57,1:30:21.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让他受苦 让他生不如死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him suffer. Make him wish he were dead. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.87,1:30:26.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢? 然后再杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? And then grant his wish. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.18,1:30:27.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.68,1:30:32.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明人不会直接攻击敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cunning warrior attacks neither body nor mind. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.18,1:30:34.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快教我 - 你要攻心 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me how! - The heart, Osborn. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.48,1:30:39.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先向他的亲人下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we attack his heart. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.86,1:30:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赐给我们今天的食物 原谅我们的过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us this day our daily bread, and forgive us our trespasses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.60,1:30:47.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也让我们原谅别人的过错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as we forgive those who trespass against us. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.87,1:30:52.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们受到诱惑 拯救我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead us not into temptation, but deliver us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.38,1:31:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deliver us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.15,1:31:03.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快说完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.82,1:31:08.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快说完 - 不受恶魔侵犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Finish it! - From evil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.46,1:31:16.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两毫克的静脉注射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two milligrams IV. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.40,1:31:19.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去拿血压计来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the BP. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.10,1:31:22.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梅婶怎么了? 她没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt May. Is she gonna be okay? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.90,1:31:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to leave. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.34,1:31:26.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 好可怕的双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - Those eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.27,1:31:30.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可怕的黄色眼晴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those horrible yellow eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.18,1:31:38.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道我是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows who I am. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.69,1:32:24.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.97,1:32:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她还好吧? - 她会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will she be okay? - She'll be fine. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.64,1:32:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她整天都在睡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been sleeping all day. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.24,1:32:36.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你来探望她 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for coming.  - Of course. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.21,1:32:43.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧? 我是说那晚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you? You okay about the other night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.28,1:32:47.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好 我不该丢下梅婶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine. I just felt bad about leaving Aunt May. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.22,1:32:50.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你跟哈利谈过吗? - 他打过电话给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you talked to Harry? - He called me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.62,1:32:53.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没打回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't called him back. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.89,1:32:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.76,1:33:00.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我爱上另一个人了 - 真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I'm in love with somebody else.  - You are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.77,1:33:03.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少我认为是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least I think I am. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.60,1:33:07.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在谈不太好 - 不会的 说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not the time to talk about it.  - No. Go on. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.84,1:33:11.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would I know his name, this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.28,1:33:14.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定觉得我很傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll think I'm a little girl with a crush. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.35,1:33:15.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.98,1:33:18.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.25,1:33:23.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我两次 但我却没见过他的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's saved my life twice, and I've never even seen his face. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.36,1:33:26.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 原来是他 - 你在嘲笑我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh. Him.  - You're laughing at me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.96,1:33:30.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我知道 他真的很酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I understand. He is extremely cool. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.13,1:33:34.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们说的那些坏事是真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do you think it's true, all the terrible things they say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.60,1:33:37.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 蜘蛛侠绝对不是坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Spider-Man, not a chance in the world. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.70,1:33:39.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我算是认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know him a little bit. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.51,1:33:42.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是他非正式的摄影师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sort of his unofficial photographer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.61,1:33:46.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他有提到过我吗? - 有啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has he mentioned me? - Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.11,1:33:48.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.15,1:33:50.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.55,1:33:55.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他问我觉得你怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked me what I thought about you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.79,1:33:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.52,1:34:02.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 "蜘蛛侠... "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "Spider-Man. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.96,1:34:08.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说: "玛莉最大的优点... "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "The great thing about M. J...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.07,1:34:10.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.43,1:34:14.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你看着她的双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when you look in her eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.28,1:34:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而她也注视着你时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and she's looking back in yours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.51,1:34:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切好像都...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everything feels...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.72,1:34:26.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,变得特别了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not quite normal. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.82,1:34:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你会同时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.16,1:34:32.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感到更坚强...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...stronger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.33,1:34:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而同时也更软弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and weaker at the same time. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.00,1:34:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会感到兴奋...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel excited...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.00,1:34:43.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同时也会感到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and at the same time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.67,1:34:45.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...terrified. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.57,1:34:52.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不大清楚那是什么感觉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is, you don't know what you feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.35,1:34:57.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只知道你想成什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...except you know what kind of man you want to be. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.69,1:35:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是完成了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as if you've...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.19,1:35:05.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,遥不可及的梦想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...reached the unreachable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.93,1:35:10.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却一点也没有准备好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you weren't ready for it. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.10,1:35:15.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你说的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.67,1:35:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, something like that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.28,1:36:04.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.12,1:36:11.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 是你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.80,1:36:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.57,1:36:26.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看错玛莉 你都说对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right about M.J.You're right about everything. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.51,1:36:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她爱上彼得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in love with Peter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.51,1:36:32.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 派克吗? - 是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Parker? - Yeah. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.51,1:36:36.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他爱不爱她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how does he feel about her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.05,1:36:40.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从四年级就暗恋她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's loved her since the 4th grade. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.55,1:36:46.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他装作没有 不过彼特根本没有爱过其它人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He pretends like he doesn't, but there's no one Peter cares for more. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.73,1:36:50.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.97,1:36:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都没有好好陪你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't always been there for you, have I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.14,1:37:01.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很忙 你是重要人物 我了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're busy. You're an important man. I understand. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.54,1:37:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是借口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no excuse. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.34,1:37:06.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你感到骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.71,1:37:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该冷落你 我会补偿你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost sight of that somewhere. But I'll make it up to you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.75,1:37:15.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要替你讨回公道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to rectify certain inequities. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.20,1:37:31.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒来 小蜘蛛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, little spider. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.07,1:37:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.94,1:37:35.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home, dear. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.71,1:37:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看来遭透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look awful. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.24,1:37:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看来美极了 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you look beautiful.  - Thank you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.78,1:37:43.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想丢下你 - 我很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't like to leave you here.  - But I'm safe here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.25,1:37:46.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能为你做什么? - 你做的够多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I do anything for you? - You do too much. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.15,1:37:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,半工半读还得陪我 你又不是超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}College, a job, all this time with me. You're not Superman, you know. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.42,1:37:54.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你终于笑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A smile. Finally. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.36,1:37:58.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从玛莉走了之后就没看你笑过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't seen one of those on your face since Mary Jane was here. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.80,1:38:01.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该是睡着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to be asleep. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.03,1:38:06.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉搬到隔壁你才六岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you were about 6 years old when M.J.'s family moved in next door. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.91,1:38:11.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当她下车时 你一看到她...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she got out of the car, and you saw her for the first time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.11,1:38:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就抓着我说: "梅婶 她是天使吗? "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you grabbed me and said, "Aunt May, is that an angel? "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.62,1:38:21.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我这么说吗? - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gee, did I say that? - You sure did. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.82,1:38:26.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔 可是哈利爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Harry's in love with her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.79,1:38:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她仍然是他的女友 - 那不是她的决定是吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's still his girl.  - Well, isn't that up to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.19,1:38:35.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她并不了解我 - 因为你不让她了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She doesn't really know who I am.  - Because you won't let her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.60,1:38:38.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是这么内向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so mysterious all the time. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.90,1:38:41.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 让她知道你有多喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, would it be so dangerous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.87,1:38:46.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to let Mary Jane know how much you care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.41,1:38:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都看得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody else knows. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.82,1:38:53.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.75,1:38:55.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.36,1:39:04.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快接呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, pick up. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.56,1:39:08.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 玛莉 - 听到哔声请留言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey M.J. - Hi. Sing your song at the beep. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.90,1:39:11.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 我是彼得 你在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}M.J., it's Peter. You there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.17,1:39:14.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂? 你在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? You there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.54,1:39:19.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道你可好 给我回电 好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just calling to check up on you. Will you call me when you get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.21,1:39:21.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.08,1:39:22.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别走...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.... {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.88,1:39:25.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别走暗巷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go up any dark alleys. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.32,1:39:27.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.22,1:39:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠能出来玩吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can Spider-Man come out to play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.16,1:39:35.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在哪儿?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.14,1:40:23.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是什么? - 真酷!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - That's cool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.01,1:40:27.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这只小蜘蛛跑到喷泉旁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The itsy-bitsy spider Went up the water spout{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.85,1:40:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就被绿恶魔杀光光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down came the goblin And took the spider out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.83,1:40:50.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绿恶魔 你干了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goblin, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.01,1:41:37.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠! 这就是为什么傻瓜才会去当英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man! This is why only fools are heroes. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.28,1:41:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你永远不知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you never know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.08,1:41:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一天哪个疯子会出个残酷的难题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when some lunatic will come along with a sadistic choice:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.38,1:41:47.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你选心爱的女人死...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let die the woman you love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.39,1:41:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是让无辜的小孩死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or suffer the little children. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.34,1:42:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 蜘蛛侠! - 救我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Spider-Man! - Save us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.34,1:42:04.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救我们!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.84,1:42:07.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快决定吧 蜘蛛侠...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your choice, Spider-Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.68,1:42:11.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当一个英雄就是要付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and see how a hero is rewarded. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.25,1:42:13.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样做! 绿恶魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it, Goblin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.49,1:42:16.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的命运掌握在你手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are who we choose to be. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.66,1:42:19.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在! 选吧! - 不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, choose! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.09,1:42:50.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody stay still!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.20,1:43:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 上面的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahoy up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.70,1:43:04.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要把船开到你的正下方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna bring the barge right under you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.08,1:43:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他又回来了! - 听好 我要你爬下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's coming back! - Listen. I need you to climb down. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.41,1:43:17.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我做不到 - 你可以的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't.  - Yes, you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.02,1:43:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉 你可以做到 而你必须做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}M.J., you can do it. You have to. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.22,1:43:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.33,1:43:32.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧 快下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on tight and go quickly. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.50,1:43:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快! - 我做不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hurry! - I can't. I can't do it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.70,1:43:40.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧了 玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Mary Jane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.90,1:44:11.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他不行了 - 他行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's not gonna make it.  - He's gonna make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.38,1:44:24.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡的时间到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to die. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.59,1:44:35.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个是给你的 - 我们应该狠狠揍你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got something for you! - We ought to kick your ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.59,1:44:39.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别惹蜘蛛侠! 你在对付救小孩的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Spider-Man alone! You'd pick on a guy saving kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.66,1:44:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢惹蜘蛛侠就是惹上全纽约的人!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mess with Spidey, you mess with New York!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.37,1:44:47.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你惹上他就得对付我们全部!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mess with one of us, you mess with all of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.42,1:45:01.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛侠 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spider-Man, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.05,1:45:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你选择了悲惨的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Misery, misery, misery. That's what you've chosen. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.22,1:45:41.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把你当朋友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I offered you friendship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.03,1:45:43.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你却不屑一顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you spat in my face. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.01,1:46:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没戏唱了 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've spun your last web, Spider-Man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.82,1:46:41.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没这么自私 我就让你的小女友...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you not been so selfish, your girlfriend's death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.32,1:46:43.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死得痛快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would have been quick. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.19,1:46:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在你把我惹火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now that you've really pissed me off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.83,1:46:52.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要慢慢地把她折磨到死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm gonna finish her nice and slow. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.33,1:46:58.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和玛莉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}M.J.and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.14,1:47:02.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会玩得很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're gonna have a hell of a time. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.29,1:47:58.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.00,1:48:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手! 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! It's me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.37,1:48:11.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奥先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Osborn. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.01,1:48:12.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.84,1:48:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀死了在阳台上的那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed those people on that balcony. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.35,1:48:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是绿恶魔干的 与我无关!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Goblin killed! I had nothing to do with it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.55,1:48:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别... 别让心魔再控制我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him take me again. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.49,1:48:22.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 保护我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg you. Protect me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.69,1:48:26.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你想杀死梅婶和玛莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to kill Aunt May. You tried to kill Mary Jane. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.42,1:48:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我没想过要杀你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.63,1:48:32.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想阻止心魔 却阻止不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop it. But I couldn't stop it. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.76,1:48:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would never hurt you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.10,1:48:37.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew from the beginning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.17,1:48:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我出事...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if anything ever happened to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.27,1:48:42.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会帮助我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was you I could count on. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.61,1:48:46.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你 彼得·派克 一定会救我 你果然做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, Peter Parker, would save me, and so you have. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.54,1:48:48.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.38,1:48:51.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.95,1:48:55.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 就像我相信你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe in me as I believed in you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.79,1:49:00.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就像是你的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been like a father to you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.16,1:49:03.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我的儿子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be a son to me now. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.60,1:49:06.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只有一个父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a father. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.23,1:49:10.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字是班·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Ben Parker. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.57,1:49:13.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永别了 蜘蛛侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Godspeed, Spider-Man. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.99,1:49:33.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.83,1:49:38.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.36,1:50:11.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.26,1:50:13.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么? !{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done? !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.99,1:50:43.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉 哈利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Harry. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.96,1:50:47.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道失去父亲时的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it's like to lose a father. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.30,1:50:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没失去他 他是被夺走的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't lose him. He was stolen from me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.11,1:50:56.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天 蜘蛛侠会付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day Spider-Man will pay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.28,1:51:01.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓要让蜘蛛侠付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear on my father's grave, Spider-Man will pay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.42,1:51:08.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好还有你 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God for you, Peter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.99,1:51:11.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一的亲人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only family I have. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.95,1:51:38.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管我怎么做...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what I do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.42,1:51:41.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么努力...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...no matter how hard I try...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.12,1:51:46.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最爱的人都会付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the ones I love will always be the ones who pay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.12,1:51:48.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(班·派克之墓  受人敬爱的丈夫和叔叔){\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.70,1:51:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定很想念他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must miss him so much. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.94,1:52:03.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失去他很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been so hard without him. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.94,1:52:09.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想跟你说一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I've been wanting to tell you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.62,1:52:12.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我在桥上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was up there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.15,1:52:16.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为自己快死了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I thought I was gonna die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.02,1:52:21.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我心里只想念一个他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there was only one person who I was thinking of. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.73,1:52:26.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他不是我一直以为会想到的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it wasn't who I thought it'd be. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.40,1:52:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可他是你 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was you, Pete. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.67,1:52:32.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想: {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept thinking:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.94,1:52:36.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我可以活下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I hope I make it through this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.21,1:52:42.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好让我再见彼得·派克一面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so I can see Peter Parker's face one more time. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.98,1:52:44.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.88,1:52:51.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个人自始至终陪着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one man who's always been there for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.92,1:52:54.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who makes me feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.33,1:52:58.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我远比自己想像的好很多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...like I'm more than I ever thought I could be. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.16,1:53:02.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I'm just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.53,1:53:04.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...me. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.07,1:53:07.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且感觉很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's okay. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.14,1:53:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.78,1:53:15.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I love you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.68,1:53:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我好爱你 彼得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much, Peter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.34,1:53:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想跟她说我有多爱她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I wanted was to tell her how much I loved her. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.28,1:53:46.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.35,1:53:50.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.98,1:53:52.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.19,1:53:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切 我的意思是 太多事情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everything. I mean, there's so much to tell. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.59,1:54:03.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 有太多事要讲了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. There's so much to tell. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.46,1:54:06.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.83,1:54:09.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会永远陪着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I will always be there for you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.13,1:54:14.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会永远照顾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always be there to take care of you. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.64,1:54:17.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you that. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.94,1:54:22.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会永远是你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will always be your friend. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.18,1:54:27.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是朋友吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a friend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.92,1:54:29.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,彼得·派克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Peter Parker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.62,1:54:34.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能给你这么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I have to give. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.82,1:55:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管我的未来怎样走...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever life holds in store for me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.65,1:55:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远忘不了这句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will never forget these words. :{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.18,1:55:11.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能力愈大 责任愈重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"With great power comes great responsibility. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.96,1:55:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的天赋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my gift. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.40,1:55:16.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也是我的诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My curse. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.00,1:55:19.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.29,1:55:21.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是蜘蛛侠!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Spider-Man. {\r}
